WAVE 6
	MILESTONE "save-edition"
	BRANCH "integration/save-edition"

WAVE 7
	MILESTONE "fix-corrupted-save"
	BRANCH "integration/fix-corrupted-save"

WAVE 13
	MILESTONE "save-manager-history"
	BRANCH "integration/save-manager-history"
	DESC "the save manager keeps the saves loaded in the browser once the reader asks for it, lists"
		+ "them on the Load save page to load them again or remove them, and lets the reader clear"
		+ "them and bound how long they stay; the loaded save and the merge result survive an"
		+ "address entered by hand"
	SOURCE "Owner ruling of 2026-09-28 when FEAT151 was refined: the saves loaded before are kept"
		+ "in a wave of their own, not in wave 10"
		PR 211

WAVE 14
	MILESTONE "fix-clean-architecture-violations"
	BRANCH "integration/fix-clean-architecture-violations"
	DESC "core-mapping keeps the meaning of Clean Architecture, not only its layer structure: the"
		+ "domain handles business names instead of the save format, the presenters receive"
		+ "application responses, the adapters take no business decision, and guards keep it so"
	RATIONALE "The wave fixes the fifteen violations of the audit"
		+ "docs/audits/2026-09-28-clean-architecture-violations.md, the first commit of its"
		+ "integration branch, one task per pull request, each task naming the violation numbers it"
		+ "fixes and carrying the grade of the worst of them as its priority"
		REF @PACKAGE.core_mapping
	SOURCE "Owner ruling on the Clean Architecture audit of 2026-09-28"
		PR 222

WAVE 15
	MILESTONE "save-manager-redesign"
	BRANCH "integration/save-manager-redesign"
	DESC "the save manager wears page F, page by page, each page reading a view model of its own:"
		+ "the Overview first, then Power, its tables before its charts, Terraformation and the"
		+ "planet page, Players, and the Merge two saves page with the application title at the top"
		+ "of the menu and the Load save page harmonised; the redesign closes in the wave, no"
		+ "section controller left, nothing of the earlier look left, the whole save manager usable"
		+ "at phone width and by keyboard"
		REF @URL.SaveManagerRedesignMockup
		REF @DECISION.AViewModelServesOneView
	SOURCE "Owner request of 2026-10-02: the redesign towards page F is delivered page by page in"
		+ "one wave, the Overview first, then Power, its tables before its charts, Terraformation,"
		+ "Players, and the Merge two saves page with the last adjustments; the pages first planned"
		+ "as six waves are one wave, their tasks being few"
		REF @URL.SaveManagerRedesignMockup
